_to_batch_dict\", ...), getattr, importlib), so counts like '17'/'7' can silently omit files that were skipped, xfailed, or reference the symbols only as strings.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f43a2d5ed5c9d493d","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 3: 'Retarget onto typed Mutations the 17 test files that pass raw-dict batches to apply() and the 7 that build plain-dict creates (found by an instrumented run; all in file impact).'","norm_id":"n1ec20865f74fe66c","priority":0.1467,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A raw-dict-batch apply() test gated behind a skip/xfail/marker not selected by the instrumented run is omitted from the '17', so it is left passing a raw dict to the new typed-only apply() and begins raising TypeError once the else-branch is removed.","A test that references _mutation_to_batch_dict / apply via a string (monkeypatch.setattr(..., \"_mutation_to_batch_dict\") or parametrized name) is invisible to the trace and is left unretargeted."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5556,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}